WEBVTT

02:27.320 --> 02:28.800
You're finally here.

02:36.840 --> 02:37.920
Yes, Master.

02:40.480 --> 02:41.480
I came to see you.

03:12.800 --> 03:13.760
Where is Xie Huai'an?

03:14.960 --> 03:15.880
We survived.

03:18.520 --> 03:19.800
Huai'an is alive too.

03:21.120 --> 03:23.560
He told us you would appear here.

03:25.160 --> 03:26.400
So we came.

03:28.680 --> 03:30.040
Master is from Tiemo.

03:31.840 --> 03:33.280
He wanted to kill Xiaoqing and me.

03:41.520 --> 03:42.440
Go on.

03:44.000 --> 03:45.240
Life or death,

03:47.720 --> 03:48.800
end it cleanly.

03:59.800 --> 04:01.200
Master.

04:02.120 --> 04:03.960
Put away your weapon.

04:05.080 --> 04:07.360
You raised us
through more than ten bitter years.

04:07.440 --> 04:09.520
Will you not even spare

04:11.400 --> 04:13.800
a moment to look at us
and hear a few words?

04:17.640 --> 04:19.600
Thrust. Block.

04:23.320 --> 04:24.960
-Like this?
-Food's ready.

04:25.040 --> 04:26.960
Come taste Chef Ye's cooking today.

04:27.040 --> 04:28.080
If it's bad, it's free.

04:28.160 --> 04:29.680
Hurry, come here. Stop practicing.

04:29.760 --> 04:30.680
I'm starving.

04:32.200 --> 04:34.640
Wow. Your cooking is really good.

04:34.720 --> 04:36.440
-Master, let us drink well tonight.
-Good.

04:37.760 --> 04:38.600
Xiaoqing.

04:39.360 --> 04:41.560
Mind your manners.
Master hasn't taken the first bite.

04:46.360 --> 04:48.280
-Thank you, Master.
-Master.

04:48.360 --> 04:49.640
You spoil her.

04:50.160 --> 04:51.560
Aren't you afraid she'll go unmarried?

04:51.640 --> 04:52.480
Here.

04:53.080 --> 04:54.040
Thank you, Master.

04:54.920 --> 04:56.720
Here, Zheng. Eat more.

04:58.280 --> 05:00.600
-Xiaoqing. Let's toast Master together.
-All right.

05:01.880 --> 05:03.520
We wish Master good health.

05:03.600 --> 05:05.320
-Good.
-Master, a toast to you.

05:05.400 --> 05:06.280
Good.

05:16.520 --> 05:18.480
Things have come to this.

05:19.880 --> 05:21.440
What more is there to say?

05:23.360 --> 05:24.600
The people of Chang'an.

05:25.120 --> 05:26.160
The people of Tiemo.

05:26.680 --> 05:28.960
Is the difference so great?

05:52.400 --> 05:54.000
Forty years ago,

05:55.640 --> 05:57.840
I once had a son and a daughter.

05:59.560 --> 06:01.720
The winter in Tiemo was too harsh.

06:02.720 --> 06:04.920
They did not survive.

06:11.440 --> 06:15.160
Later, war broke out again.

06:15.680 --> 06:17.280
I fled in panic.

06:20.720 --> 06:21.840
After that,

06:23.120 --> 06:27.160
I received orders to enter Chang'an
as a shadow guard.

06:28.440 --> 06:30.680
I then served under General Liu Ziwen.

06:33.280 --> 06:34.760
A few years passed.

06:34.840 --> 06:36.720
In Basong Town,

06:37.880 --> 06:40.000
I found you and Xiaoqing.

06:42.240 --> 06:44.760
I raised you to adulthood.

06:45.280 --> 06:48.280
Taught you martial arts and medicine.

06:50.000 --> 06:51.560
I once believed

06:54.960 --> 06:57.720
that I had another pair of children.

07:01.120 --> 07:02.040
But…

07:04.000 --> 07:05.920
But I cannot forget.

07:10.240 --> 07:13.000
I cannot forget what I have just said.

07:14.480 --> 07:16.160
War came again.

07:17.080 --> 07:18.840
I fled in haste.

07:20.600 --> 07:22.240
During that evacuation,

07:24.640 --> 07:30.280
I never had the chance
to bury my children.

07:40.800 --> 07:42.920
If my homeland were still there,

07:43.840 --> 07:46.120
if the house had not collapsed,

07:46.920 --> 07:49.560
my son and daughter's remains

07:51.960 --> 07:53.560
must still be there.

07:59.240 --> 08:01.400
With such memories in my heart,

08:01.480 --> 08:06.160
how could I cling to our past?

08:27.680 --> 08:29.920
Master, thank you for raising me.

08:50.600 --> 08:52.440
We understand now.

08:54.640 --> 08:57.680
We have no right to resent you.

09:12.160 --> 09:14.520
None of us has the right
to hate one another.

09:19.520 --> 09:20.800
If hatred must exist,

09:24.120 --> 09:26.920
let it be toward the merciless heavens.

09:32.840 --> 09:35.760
Children, rise.

09:53.360 --> 09:56.320
If you intend to stop me
from killing Xie Huai'an,

09:59.040 --> 10:02.440
then you must take my blade.

10:05.920 --> 10:06.760
Master.

10:09.440 --> 10:10.560
Master!

10:47.800 --> 10:49.720
You were the ones who brought the rice.

10:52.960 --> 10:54.400
Back at Cangshui River,

10:55.840 --> 10:57.520
I saw Master slip out at night,

10:59.280 --> 11:00.680
so I followed.

11:02.840 --> 11:06.640
Only then did I learn that Master kept
two memorial tablets hidden in a cave.

11:10.160 --> 11:12.040
I did not know whose spirits you honored,

11:15.840 --> 11:19.680
but we thought they must be dear to you.

11:23.400 --> 11:24.760
So Xiaoqing and I

11:26.200 --> 11:28.200
would go there to pay respects
from time to time.

12:16.200 --> 12:17.720
Now we understand.

12:20.520 --> 12:22.960
They were Master's children.

12:26.440 --> 12:27.720
But Master,

12:32.200 --> 12:34.280
we are your children too.

12:44.560 --> 12:45.600
Master,

12:47.280 --> 12:49.720
we are your children as well.

13:29.560 --> 13:30.480
Master.

13:34.800 --> 13:35.680
Master.

14:01.880 --> 14:02.840
The people of Chang'an.

14:03.480 --> 14:04.640
The people of Tiemo.

14:05.320 --> 14:07.320
Is the difference truly so great?

14:09.240 --> 14:10.560
But Master,

14:13.120 --> 14:15.040
we are your children too.

14:15.120 --> 14:16.280
Master.

14:17.840 --> 14:20.320
We are your children too.

15:02.880 --> 15:04.520
When Chang'an falls,

15:05.440 --> 15:07.280
even in winter,

15:07.840 --> 15:10.640
no Tiemo people will go hungry again.

15:12.680 --> 15:15.400
If only you were born in such a time,

15:17.200 --> 15:18.440
how wonderful it would be.

15:31.400 --> 15:33.040
What should I do?

15:49.240 --> 15:50.280
My children…

15:54.640 --> 15:56.000
What should I do?

15:57.720 --> 15:59.920
Your identity has been exposed.

16:01.800 --> 16:05.680
As for your two disciples,
how do you plan to deal with them?

16:06.440 --> 16:10.160
Your Majesty must know
why I followed you back then.

16:10.760 --> 16:12.120
Of course I know.

16:13.320 --> 16:17.520
Because your children died
in the winter of Tiemo.

16:18.320 --> 16:20.800
Tiemo's winters are bitterly cold.

16:21.320 --> 16:25.320
So many children
never survive the harsh season.

16:25.840 --> 16:28.000
I believe you will not betray us,

16:28.880 --> 16:32.480
because your children watch over you

16:33.880 --> 16:35.200
from the heavens.

17:52.040 --> 17:55.120
My children's bodies…

18:01.600 --> 18:04.040
My own son and daughter

18:05.280 --> 18:08.360
weren't even laid to rest.

18:12.000 --> 18:14.080
Where else is there for me to go?

18:32.360 --> 18:33.800
Is it you?

18:34.440 --> 18:35.640
White Hair.

18:37.440 --> 18:38.680
You win.

18:45.320 --> 18:46.280
Mr. Long.

18:48.080 --> 18:49.520
My father once told me

18:51.480 --> 18:53.960
that in a village
at the foot of Wuxi Mountain,

18:55.160 --> 18:56.360
before a house,

18:57.480 --> 18:59.640
there stood a stone hut of pale ash wood.

19:04.480 --> 19:05.920
There should be…

19:10.120 --> 19:11.800
two children's remains buried there.

19:23.560 --> 19:24.760
Seven years ago,

19:27.440 --> 19:30.840
I went to Wuxi Mountain
and saved Pu Nichuan.

19:33.160 --> 19:35.080
I also visited that stone hut.

19:39.080 --> 19:40.240
Rest easy.

19:42.160 --> 19:43.640
Your children…

19:45.480 --> 19:47.040
have been laid to rest.

20:11.600 --> 20:16.120
In every letter, you wrote
about how you endured hardship

20:16.640 --> 20:17.640
and wandered far and wide.

20:18.680 --> 20:22.000
Looking at you now, you have held up well.

20:23.320 --> 20:24.200
White Hair,

20:25.240 --> 20:28.520
your father and I shared one wish.

20:30.480 --> 20:33.080
We only hoped you could live safely,

20:35.640 --> 20:37.680
long enough to grow old and gray in peace.

20:41.040 --> 20:42.000
Child,

20:44.520 --> 20:45.560
come back alive.

22:01.600 --> 22:03.400
The King of Tiemo is gone.

22:04.520 --> 22:06.680
He cares nothing for your life or death.

22:31.560 --> 22:32.440
Let's go.

22:33.480 --> 22:34.440
Take it slow.

22:38.160 --> 22:39.840
‎-Come on.
‎-Let's move.

22:45.960 --> 22:48.440
Xiaobing. You don't want to leave, do you?

22:50.640 --> 22:51.800
Even if I don't, I must.

22:52.600 --> 22:53.920
I fear Tiemo's attack as well.

22:54.000 --> 22:56.160
But I still gave someone my word,
and haven't fulfilled it.

23:00.560 --> 23:01.720
Let's go.

23:28.520 --> 23:29.360
Xiaobing.

23:31.920 --> 23:33.320
What are you two doing?

23:33.400 --> 23:36.040
Sir, His Majesty ordered me
to protect you.

23:36.640 --> 23:39.080
If I give my word, I will see it done.

23:39.800 --> 23:41.560
My sister and I will escort you to Huzhou.

23:45.440 --> 23:47.320
Look at these troubled times.

23:47.400 --> 23:49.720
Why must you two take such risks?

23:49.800 --> 23:51.680
War is coming.
It's the same wherever we go.

23:51.760 --> 23:54.840
Huzhou is farther away.
Perhaps the war won't reach there.

23:54.920 --> 23:57.600
-Sir. Don't feel indebted.
-No…

23:58.160 --> 24:01.600
In times like these,
common folk should help each other.

24:01.680 --> 24:02.520
Will this do?

24:04.440 --> 24:06.000
It will.

24:06.600 --> 24:11.880
Huzhou is far,
so maybe we can avoid the war.

24:13.040 --> 24:16.000
Food, clothes, and expenses on the road
will all be my responsibility.

24:16.080 --> 24:17.960
-Sir, don't stand on ceremony.
-No.

24:18.040 --> 24:19.520
You may command me
along the road as you wish.

24:19.600 --> 24:21.880
Serving tea, fetching water,
massaging legs, just call me.

24:21.960 --> 24:23.400
Treat me as you would your own son.

24:30.080 --> 24:31.840
Sir, are you alright?

24:31.920 --> 24:34.200
I'm fine. I'm fine, child.

24:35.320 --> 24:37.280
Xiaobing, Xiaoding. Come.

24:37.800 --> 24:39.120
Take me to Huzhou.

24:39.640 --> 24:40.920
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

24:44.720 --> 24:46.320
Come, over here. Come.

25:03.120 --> 25:05.600
Come on. Let's head off.

25:50.520 --> 25:52.320
How is it? Are you alright?

26:14.680 --> 26:15.560
Sorry to keep you waiting.

26:16.360 --> 26:17.360
Is the porridge ready?

26:18.080 --> 26:19.760
Sorry to keep you waiting. It's ready.

26:27.040 --> 26:31.000
The Emperor of the Xiao line
is now in the King of Tiemo's hands.

26:31.520 --> 26:34.120
Chang'an now hangs by a thread.

26:34.200 --> 26:36.560
Even on the brink, we still eat porridge.

26:46.000 --> 26:47.760
The battle must have gone terribly.

26:52.360 --> 26:53.720
It truly was a heavy defeat.

26:58.560 --> 26:59.880
At least we still have porridge.

27:04.800 --> 27:06.080
I thought I would never

27:07.880 --> 27:09.400
see the Grand Preceptor again.

27:13.080 --> 27:14.480
You will not see the Grand Preceptor.

27:15.120 --> 27:16.560
What you see is Cen Pickles.

27:16.640 --> 27:20.480
CEN WEIZONG

27:25.800 --> 27:27.320
Ye Zheng. Eat your porridge.

27:28.640 --> 27:29.640
You remember me?

27:32.040 --> 27:34.400
Child, have a bowl. Warm yourself.

27:49.040 --> 27:50.360
Old sir,

27:51.000 --> 27:54.920
why is your courtyard full of pickles?

27:58.280 --> 28:00.040
Winters are long.

28:00.120 --> 28:01.960
Fresh food won't last in the cellar.

28:02.480 --> 28:06.240
Pickling them brings out a richer taste.

28:09.880 --> 28:11.880
I met your master when we were young.

28:13.960 --> 28:17.040
After I retired from the world,
we lost touch.

28:18.480 --> 28:21.160
I remember when he took you two in,

28:22.440 --> 28:24.280
he said he might live in Chang'an forever.

28:26.040 --> 28:27.440
I naively believed

28:29.440 --> 28:30.840
he would forget the past.

28:36.080 --> 28:38.040
Now all has returned to dust.

28:39.400 --> 28:40.760
Remember his kindness.

28:42.120 --> 28:43.040
That is enough.

28:50.880 --> 28:54.880
With that in your hearts,
you will find peace.

29:13.800 --> 29:14.760
Do not blame him.

29:36.320 --> 29:38.400
You, and Gu Yu,

29:39.520 --> 29:40.640
both remarkable people.

29:42.760 --> 29:45.000
Gu Yu survived 30 days on dry buns alone.

29:46.000 --> 29:47.360
I think you outdo him.

29:48.880 --> 29:51.760
You could last 30 days
without food or water.

29:53.440 --> 29:54.720
This is Ronghua Alley, then?

29:57.160 --> 29:58.680
Yes, and all the neighbors

30:00.240 --> 30:02.200
around here are trustworthy.

30:03.600 --> 30:06.160
For years, I bribed them with pickles.

30:07.080 --> 30:10.520
Staying here should keep you safe
for a few days.

30:13.560 --> 30:15.040
You might not stay safe for long.

30:17.000 --> 30:20.480
There is something I wish to ask of you.

30:20.560 --> 30:21.600
I know.

30:22.280 --> 30:24.400
I return to the palace tonight for duty.

30:32.480 --> 30:34.040
Chang'an is about to change.

30:35.520 --> 30:36.800
Please find a way

30:38.520 --> 30:39.760
for that person to survive.

30:40.360 --> 30:41.800
That child is no concern of yours.

30:42.520 --> 30:44.600
I will see to proper arrangements.

30:49.000 --> 30:52.280
What you should consider
is a path of survival for yourself.

31:01.520 --> 31:05.360
Ye Zheng told me you struck a bargain
with Yan Fengshan's men.

31:06.760 --> 31:11.000
If you defeat the Tiemo forces,
they may take your head.

31:14.520 --> 31:15.640
Yes.

31:19.280 --> 31:21.720
If you defeat Tiemo, you die.

31:22.400 --> 31:25.640
If you drive them away, you still die.

31:26.480 --> 31:27.320
White Hair.

31:27.840 --> 31:32.920
Have you ever wondered
what you have lived for all your life?

31:37.600 --> 31:38.800
If you can understand this,

31:39.560 --> 31:42.640
then no matter whether
there is a way out of your dead end,

31:43.360 --> 31:45.240
your life will not have been in vain.

31:49.120 --> 31:50.360
My thanks, Grand Preceptor.

31:56.560 --> 31:57.800
The sky has yet to brighten.

31:57.880 --> 31:59.440
Will you not take a lantern?

32:00.160 --> 32:01.360
No need.

32:07.040 --> 32:08.960
I walk as dust upon this world,

32:09.040 --> 32:10.920
and heaven and earth
bear the light for me.

32:40.720 --> 32:44.680
I faintly sensed the Grand Preceptor
was the one who saved me.

32:48.040 --> 32:50.360
That night, after Su Changlin wounded me,

32:52.440 --> 32:53.600
then…

33:14.600 --> 33:15.440
Yes.

33:16.520 --> 33:17.400
It was him.

33:19.000 --> 33:20.280
The Grand Preceptor saved me.

33:22.760 --> 33:26.040
Huai'an, he is someone
we can trust, isn't he?

33:38.920 --> 33:40.720
Fifteen years ago,
the night the Lius were slain,

33:42.800 --> 33:44.760
he should have died there.

33:46.640 --> 33:50.680
My father hung a red ribbon on a tree,

33:53.040 --> 33:55.040
warning him that the Huben Army
had mutinied,

33:56.120 --> 33:57.800
and thus he escaped death.

34:03.040 --> 34:05.000
WANG'S CLINIC

34:05.080 --> 34:09.360
Yan Fengshan and the King of Tiemo
betrayed my father,

34:09.960 --> 34:11.480
and betrayed the Grand Preceptor.

34:13.000 --> 34:16.639
Those who share an enemy
can at least trust each other.

34:21.840 --> 34:24.800
The army has pushed 300 li
past the North Office.

34:25.480 --> 34:27.880
Yet the four regional commanders
who hold great legions

34:27.960 --> 34:29.280
have made no move.

34:30.280 --> 34:33.159
No rations prepared, no troops mobilized,

34:34.560 --> 34:36.679
as if they have chosen to sit and watch.

34:38.719 --> 34:41.760
We have 200,000 soldiers,
hardly a lone force charging deep.

34:43.840 --> 34:45.920
And with Xiao Wuyang already in our hands.

34:50.679 --> 34:53.280
Your Majesty, we can take Chang'an now.

35:12.360 --> 35:15.080
-Hold on to it.
-Thank you.

35:16.120 --> 35:19.400
-Clear the way!
-How much? Please warm up the flatbread.

35:19.480 --> 35:20.920
Urgent military report
to the central court!

35:21.000 --> 35:21.960
Clear the way!

35:22.040 --> 35:22.880
Watch the road.

35:22.960 --> 35:24.680
-Urgent report to the central court!
-Take care.

35:24.760 --> 35:27.120
-Clear the way!
-Lately, news has been pouring in fast.

35:27.800 --> 35:30.520
They say the Tiemo people
have reached the North Office.

35:30.600 --> 35:33.360
And I heard at Changle Post
outside the city, everyone was killed.

35:33.440 --> 35:35.800
Could be the Tiemo people
are already near Chang'an.

35:37.120 --> 35:40.200
I also heard there's a place
outside the city called Cangshui River,

35:40.280 --> 35:43.280
and I heard
many were killed there as well.

35:44.000 --> 35:45.200
Truly too tragic.

35:46.520 --> 35:48.080
These are troubled times indeed.

36:11.920 --> 36:13.480
The war reports come faster each day.

36:13.560 --> 36:15.040
Soon, the Tiemo will be here.

36:16.440 --> 36:17.880
The commander, Xie Huai'an, is missing.

36:18.920 --> 36:20.000
His Majesty's fate is unknown.

36:22.040 --> 36:24.320
And so we wait here,
letting grain and fodder go to waste.

36:27.480 --> 36:28.920
If you ask me,

36:29.000 --> 36:31.520
we should march north
and fight the Tiemo head-on.

36:33.440 --> 36:34.720
Did you read the report?

36:35.320 --> 36:37.680
The Tiemo drove straight through.

36:37.760 --> 36:41.720
The Baiwenhu Army fell quickly,
and none of the regional commanders moved.

36:41.800 --> 36:46.280
If we rush out now and fight,
what if we lose?

36:46.360 --> 36:47.920
Then what of Chang'an?

36:54.360 --> 36:56.000
I believe His Majesty still lives.

36:57.400 --> 37:00.640
I believe in Mr. Xie Huai'an as well,
the one who holds the command.

37:00.720 --> 37:02.120
He must have a plan.

37:02.880 --> 37:04.600
Even Yan Fengshan,
the man no blade could kill,

37:05.200 --> 37:06.560
fell to him in the end.

37:07.400 --> 37:10.360
Would the Tiemo be harder to fight
than Yan Fengshan?

37:13.400 --> 37:16.680
Maybe. But panicking will not help us.

37:17.680 --> 37:18.920
We wait.

37:44.280 --> 37:46.560
Military grounds. No unauthorized entry.

37:56.240 --> 37:57.360
I request to see the generals.

38:10.440 --> 38:12.880
The Wuyang Token belongs
to Mr. Xie Huai'an.

38:14.200 --> 38:16.080
Did he send you?

38:17.560 --> 38:18.520
I…

38:21.480 --> 38:22.440
No.

38:25.760 --> 38:28.160
I come on behalf of the King of Tiemo.

38:31.400 --> 38:33.160
Speak clearly.

38:51.360 --> 38:53.880
Generals, you have followed His Majesty
for many years.

39:04.160 --> 39:06.320
The scar on the arm

39:10.920 --> 39:12.480
is real.

39:12.560 --> 39:13.600
This…

39:16.560 --> 39:17.800
I believe you

39:19.160 --> 39:20.640
recognize it.

39:22.320 --> 39:23.280
Where is His Majesty?

39:24.200 --> 39:25.240
Tell me.

39:26.360 --> 39:27.720
Where is His Majesty?

40:00.480 --> 40:01.720
The King of Tiemo

40:05.800 --> 40:07.640
sent me here

40:08.760 --> 40:09.920
with a message.

40:11.760 --> 40:13.680
Chang'an will fall.

40:15.160 --> 40:17.280
The Wuyang Army must not storm the city.

40:19.480 --> 40:20.680
If you refuse,

40:23.040 --> 40:24.480
His Majesty dies.

40:25.080 --> 40:27.560
What? Impossible.

40:28.600 --> 40:30.720
The Tiemo are still 500 li away.

40:34.360 --> 40:36.200
Their shadow guards
are already in the city.

40:36.840 --> 40:39.400
They are using Huben tactics now.

40:40.040 --> 40:42.160
The Wuyang Army must not attack.

40:42.960 --> 40:44.160
If you do,

40:46.560 --> 40:47.960
the Emperor will die.

40:50.760 --> 40:52.600
When will the Tiemo strike?

41:00.200 --> 41:01.280
I fear

41:04.320 --> 41:05.280
we are already too late.

